* Editing Helpers

** Rainbow Delimiters

Highlight matching parens/brackets/braces with rainbow colors in
code buffers.

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(use-package rainbow-delimiters
  :ensure t
  :hook (prog-mode . rainbow-delimiters-mode))
#+end_src

** Vundo

Visualizes undo history as a tree instead of a linear stack, so
branches created by undoing-then-editing are never lost or
confusing to navigate. Replaces the default linear ~undo~ binding.

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(use-package vundo
  :bind
  ("C-x u" . vundo))
#+end_src

* Themes

Doom Themes provides the color theme plus small integrations (a
flashing mode-line on errors, and better =org-mode= fontification).

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(setq custom-safe-themes t)
(use-package doom-themes
  :ensure t
  :config
  ;; Global settings (optional).
  (setq doom-themes-enable-bold t
        doom-themes-enable-italic t)

  ;; Load the theme (choose your favorite).
  (load-theme 'doom-molokai t)

  ;; Enable flashing mode-line on errors.
  (doom-themes-visual-bell-config)

  ;; Corrects (and improves) org-mode's native fontification.
  (doom-themes-org-config))
#+end_src
